%******************************************************************************
\chapter{Core Data Structures}
%******************************************************************************

%claude:
This chapter introduces, in one place, the key types that flow through
every layer described in the Overview: the [[chisql]] AST produced by
the parser, the [[chidb_dbm_op_t]] bytecode instruction the code
generator emits, the in-memory schema the API keeps around, and the
on-disk B-Tree/page structures the bottom two layers manipulate. The
chapters that follow each revisit the subset of these types relevant
to that layer's logic.

\section{The [[chisql]] AST}

%claude:
Statements, tables, columns, conditions, and literals, as produced by
[[sql.y]] and consumed by the optimizer and code generator; see
[[include/chisql/*.h]].

\section{DBM bytecode: [[chidb_dbm_op_t]]}

%claude:
One opcode, three integer arguments, and a string argument --- the
single instruction shape every DBM program is built out of; see
[[dbm-types.h]].

\section{The in-memory schema}

%claude:
[[chidb_schema_item_t]], loaded from the page-1 schema table on
[[chidb_open]] and refreshed after every [[CREATE TABLE]]/[[CREATE
INDEX]], is how the optimizer and code generator resolve table/column
names to root pages without re-walking the B-Tree.

\section{B-Tree pages and cursors}

%claude:
The on-disk node layout B-Trees read and write, and the
[[chidb_dbm_cursor_t]] table/index cursors that opcodes like [[Next]]
and [[Seek*]] drive.

%******************************************************************************
\chapter{[[main()]]}
%******************************************************************************

%claude:
Unlike a compiler or a shell, [[chidb]] has no single natural
``main'': it is a library, and its real entry points are the public
API in [[chidb.h]] --- [[chidb_open]], [[chidb_prepare]],
[[chidb_step]], [[chidb_finalize]], [[chidb_close]] --- which
[[src/shell/main.c]] and its REPL loop call in sequence. This chapter
walks that sequence once, end to end, before the following chapters
each dive into one layer of it.

