\chapter{Conclusion}
%******************************************************************************

%claude:
You now know how [[chidb]] works: how a SQL query becomes an AST, how
the optimizer and code generator turn that AST into DBM bytecode, and
how that bytecode drives B-Trees and a pager to read and write an
actual file on disk.

